<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1738629466"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:21.676"><div begin="13.615" end="37.227" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.615" end="19.440" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.615" end="15.264">曾经站得</span><span begin="15.264" end="16.203">高</span> <span begin="16.243" end="16.997">也会</span><span begin="16.997" end="17.724">让</span><span begin="17.724" end="18.477">我害</span><span begin="18.477" end="19.440">怕</span></p><p begin="19.944" end="24.659" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.944" end="21.529">只能感到</span><span begin="21.529" end="22.397">心</span><span begin="22.397" end="23.108">在</span><span begin="23.108" end="24.659">跳</span></p><p begin="26.295" end="32.541" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.295" end="27.892">你说你想</span><span begin="27.892" end="28.700">看</span><span begin="28.700" end="29.562">到最</span><span begin="29.562" end="30.360">美</span><span begin="30.360" end="31.159">的风</span><span begin="31.159" end="32.541">景</span></p><p begin="32.689" end="37.227" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.689" end="34.222">我就带你</span><span begin="34.222" end="34.902">去</span><span begin="34.997" end="35.819">山</span><span begin="35.852" end="37.227">顶</span></p></div><div begin="38.527" end="48.395" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="38.527" end="43.221" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.527" end="38.911">多</span><span begin="38.911" end="39.932">想</span> <span begin="40.854" end="42.040">不管到多远</span><span begin="42.040" end="42.228">的</span><span begin="42.228" end="42.560">地</span><span begin="42.560" end="43.221">方</span></p><p begin="44.877" end="48.395" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.877" end="45.393">都</span><span begin="45.393" end="46.606">能带着</span><span begin="46.606" end="48.395">你</span></p></div><div begin="51.114" end="1:17.984" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="51.114" end="56.021" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.114" end="51.685">是</span><span begin="51.685" end="53.219">你</span> <span begin="53.595" end="54.358">治愈了</span><span begin="54.358" end="54.825">我的</span><span begin="54.825" end="55.231">孤</span><span begin="55.231" end="56.021">单</span></p><p begin="56.615" end="59.029" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.615" end="58.013">而你却不自</span><span begin="58.013" end="59.029">知</span></p><p begin="1:00.497" end="1:04.344" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.497" end="1:01.371">就像分</span><span begin="1:01.371" end="1:02.456">我心爱的</span><span begin="1:02.456" end="1:02.705">玩</span><span begin="1:02.705" end="1:03.813">具的孩</span><span begin="1:03.813" end="1:04.344">子</span></p><p begin="1:04.354" end="1:09.435" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.354" end="1:05.575">你</span> <span begin="1:06.048" end="1:06.966">消除我</span><span begin="1:06.966" end="1:08.132">所有恐惧</span><span begin="1:08.132" end="1:08.531">的</span><span begin="1:08.531" end="1:08.872">未</span><span begin="1:08.872" end="1:09.435">知</span></p><p begin="1:09.445" end="1:13.383" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.445" end="1:10.954">而你却不自</span><span begin="1:10.954" end="1:13.383">知</span></p><p begin="1:13.459" end="1:17.984" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.459" end="1:13.745">还</span><span begin="1:13.745" end="1:14.622">轻轻地</span><span begin="1:14.622" end="1:15.384">问我在</span><span begin="1:15.384" end="1:16.282">笑</span><span begin="1:16.704" end="1:17.073">什</span><span begin="1:17.073" end="1:17.984">么</span></p></div><div begin="1:43.548" end="2:07.233" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:43.548" end="1:49.313" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.548" end="1:45.172">曾经爱得</span><span begin="1:45.172" end="1:46.042">深</span> <span begin="1:46.042" end="1:46.853">也曾</span><span begin="1:46.853" end="1:47.681">失</span><span begin="1:47.681" end="1:48.444">去自</span><span begin="1:48.444" end="1:49.313">己</span></p><p begin="1:49.900" end="1:54.814" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.900" end="1:51.629">只懂短促</span><span begin="1:51.629" end="1:53.127">的呼</span><span begin="1:53.127" end="1:54.814">吸</span></p><p begin="1:56.270" end="2:02.526" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.270" end="1:57.952">在这混乱</span><span begin="1:57.952" end="1:58.752">而</span><span begin="1:58.808" end="1:59.584">荒谬</span><span begin="1:59.584" end="2:01.095">的世</span><span begin="2:01.095" end="2:02.526">界</span></p><p begin="2:02.600" end="2:07.233" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.600" end="2:04.257">我该如何</span><span begin="2:04.257" end="2:05.855">守护</span><span begin="2:05.855" end="2:07.233">你</span></p></div><div begin="2:08.508" end="2:18.385" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="2:08.508" end="2:13.322" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.508" end="2:08.890">多</span><span begin="2:08.890" end="2:09.843">想</span> <span begin="2:10.904" end="2:12.205">找个最安全的</span><span begin="2:12.205" end="2:12.553">地</span><span begin="2:12.553" end="2:13.322">方</span></p><p begin="2:14.886" end="2:18.385" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.886" end="2:16.178">好好陪</span><span begin="2:16.178" end="2:16.696">着</span><span begin="2:16.696" end="2:18.385">你</span></p></div><div begin="2:21.121" end="2:48.409" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:21.121" end="2:26.028" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.121" end="2:21.791">是</span><span begin="2:21.791" end="2:23.346">你</span> <span begin="2:23.510" end="2:24.330">治愈了</span><span begin="2:24.330" end="2:24.818">我的</span><span begin="2:24.818" end="2:25.217">孤</span><span begin="2:25.217" end="2:26.028">单</span></p><p begin="2:26.758" end="2:29.172" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.758" end="2:28.111">而你却不自</span><span begin="2:28.111" end="2:29.172">知</span></p><p begin="2:30.621" end="2:34.150" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:30.621" end="2:31.44